{
  "info": {
    "name": "HustleHub Part 2 \u2014 DRAFT contract tests",
    "description": "AI foundation for Blake/Hamza. New routes are proposals, NOT implemented in Part 1. Review the contract and use a test database. No live results are claimed. Expand JWT, rate-limit, malformed-input and transaction-failure cases before final submission.",
